# Company.Portal

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root.

Architecture: CMS-backed modular monolith + BFF + Angular. Not a system-wide onion. CMS is infrastructure. Invoices are a clean module.

C# follows csharpcodingguidelines.com + thangchung/clean-code-dotnet. Conflicts: no underscore fields, max 3 args, no Async suffix without a sync twin, feature projects, braces on new lines, internal sealed by default.

Verify with `dotnet test Company.Portal.sln`.
